meta {
  name: 01 Auth
  seq: 2
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  Register this collection as a SMART backend client (idempotent: 409 = already registered), then get a token. The private key is read from `privateKeyPath` (relative to the collection folder) and never leaves the machine. The collection pre-request script also fetches a token automatically when one is missing or expiring.
}
